  "uncertainties": [
    "Official code tags are paper snapshots, not an explicit version-by-version mapping; the 2505 code tag predates paper v3.",
    "MATLAB executable, CVX and MOSEK exact installed builds and solver tolerances are not pinned in the scripts.",
    "2403 equation (8.73) labels P1/D0 errors as5e-6/6e-6, while the snapshot assigns eP1=6e-6/eD0=5e-6; preserve the executable branch explicitly.",
    "No reviewed source establishes that all continuous-energy and all-spin unitarity violations are excluded.",
    "No equivalence proof transfers the later PV/midpoint finite discretization to the current coherent finite-sine family."
  ],
  "prototype_implications": [
    "First establish a source-faithful finite-operator and standard-conic baseline before additional solver tuning.",
    "Compare analytic Legendre-Q/PV kernels, row order, actual rho2 packing, and author cone rescaling independently.",
    "Separate published numerical replication from stronger off-grid/high-spin/interval verification and label any constraint feedback as an enhanced finite problem.",
